# REQUIRED API KEYS & CONFIGURATIONS

To make this Advanced Agentic RAG work perfectly (including Web Search, Wikipedia, PDF RAG, and Notion Integration), you need to add the following variables to your `.env` file located at: `/Users/yashsonawane/Advance structural /.env`

```env
# 1. Google Gemini API Key (Required for the core AI Agent)
# Get it here: https://aistudio.google.com/app/apikey
GOOGLE_API_KEY=your_google_api_key_here

# 2. Notion Internal Integration Token (Required for Notion Access)
# Get it here: https://www.notion.so/my-integrations
# Create a new integration, copy the "Internal Integration Secret".
# IMPORTANT: You must "Share" the specific Notion pages/databases you want the agent to see with your integration.
NOTION_TOKEN=secret_your_notion_token_here
```

### Have Everything?
Once you have pasted your real keys into the `.env` file, the Agent will have *everything* it needs to:
- Browse the web
- Search Wikipedia
- Read local PDFs
- Read your Notion workspace
